{"task_id": "a18913d547d5ddd4", "model_key": "zai-glm-5-3-flash", "raw_response": "I'll solve this 5×5 system by Gaussian elimination.\n\n**Setup** (with x1 eliminated from rows 2–4 first, keeping integer-scaled rows):\n\n- E2: 139x₂ + 612x₃ − 636x₄ + 711x₅ = −4666\n- E3: −184x₂ − 57x₃ − 459x₄ + 144x₅ = 1021\n- E4: −181x₂ − 168x₃ − 366x₄ − 309x₅ = 1084\n- E5: −7x₂ + 9x₃ − 19x₄ + 12x₅ = −39\n\n**Eliminate x₂** (combining rows, dividing out common factors):\n- F1: 6979x₃ − 12055x₄ + 10056x₅ = −47775\n- F2: 2914x₃ − 5533x₄ + 2858x₅ = −23129\n- F3: 5535x₃ − 7093x₄ + 6645x₅ = −38083\n\n**Eliminate x₃**:\n- G1: 3,486,537x₄ + 9,357,202x₅ = 22,200,941\n- G2: −17,222,378x₄ + 9,284,505x₅ = 1,346,632\n\nSubstituting x₄ = (22,200,941 − 9,357,202x₅)/3,486,537 into G2 and clearing denominators:\n\n(193,524,040,075,541)·x₅ = 387,048,080,151,082\n\nSince 193,524,040,075,541 × 2 = 387,048,080,151,082, we get **x₅ = 2**.\n\n**Back-substitution:**\n- G1: 3,486,537x₄ + 9,357,202(2) = 22,200,941 → x₄ = 3,486,537/3,486,537 = **1**\n- F2: 2914x₃ − 5533(1) + 2858(2) = −23129 → 2914x₃ = −23312 → **x₃ = −8**\n- E2: 139x₂ + 612(−8) − 636(1) + 711(2) = −4666 → 139x₂ = −556 → **x₂ = −4**\n- Row 1: 30x₁ − 7(−4) + 24(−8) − 12(1) − 3(2) = −362 → 30x₁ = −180 → **x₁ = −6**\n\n**Verification** with (−6, −4, −8, 1, 2):\n- Eq1: −180 + 28 − 192 − 12 − 6 = −362 ✓\n- Eq2: 138 − 40 − 16 − 12 + 52 = 122 ✓\n- Eq3: 84 + 36 + 120 − 25 + 22 = 237 ✓\n- Eq4: −24 + 52 + 64 − 26 − 42 = 24 ✓\n- Eq5: 28 − 72 − 19 + 24 = −39 ✓\n\nAll five equations check exactly.\n\n{\"answer\": [-6, -4, -8, 1, 2]}", "parsed_answer": "[-6, -4, -8, 1, 2]", "correct": true, "parse_status": "correct", "error": null, "latency_ms": 141225, "usage": {"input": 384, "output": 11932, "cacheRead": 0, "cacheWrite": 0, "reasoning": 11067, "totalTokens": 12316, "cost": {"input": 5.76e-05, "output": 0.005966, "cacheRead": 0, "cacheWrite": 0, "total": 0.0060236}}, "cost_usd": 0.0060236, "attempts": 1, "model_info": {"provider": "opencode-go", "model